WEBVTT

00:45.120 --> 00:51.367
The ache is deeper now, a steady beat. Stuck to

00:51.407 --> 00:58.383
this vinyl, sticky seat. The endless plains of

00:58.503 --> 01:07.686
brown and grey Another piece of me slips away The

01:07.746 --> 01:14.028
world outside is vast and dead Matches the

01:14.148 --> 01:22.011
silence in my head My body's screaming needs a

01:22.171 --> 01:30.353
sign Somewhere on the side of a whole line Are you

01:30.413 --> 01:37.620
my lover? Or are you my guard? Is this a journey or

01:37.680 --> 01:44.205
a prison yard? There's a lock on the door, a bar on

01:44.245 --> 01:49.590
the sky And I'm starting to see the truth behind

01:49.610 --> 01:56.035
the lie A different kind of chill inside my soul

01:59.175 --> 02:03.019
You hold the

02:08.025 --> 02:13.792
wallet, you hold the key

02:20.078 --> 02:27.629
To every single heart of me I see you watching

02:27.729 --> 02:35.788
from your seat Your victory feels so complete

02:36.648 --> 02:42.712
This wasn't an adventure, not a game You just

02:42.772 --> 02:50.017
needed someone else to blame A trophy for your

02:50.137 --> 02:59.442
bitter prize Reflected in your empty eyes Are

02:59.482 --> 03:07.084
you my lover? Are you my God? Is this a journey or a

03:07.204 --> 03:13.485
prison? Yeah, there's a lock on the door, a bar on

03:13.525 --> 03:18.887
the sky And I'm starting to see the truth behind

03:18.927 --> 03:26.150
the lie a different kind of chill inside my soul a

03:26.310 --> 03:31.232
creeping loss of all control

04:17.420 --> 04:24.530
Are you my love? Are you my God? Is this a journey

04:24.830 --> 04:31.493
or a prison yard? There's a lock on the door, a bar

04:31.553 --> 04:35.836
on the sky And I'm starting to see the truth

04:36.176 --> 04:42.239
behind the lie A different kind of chill inside

04:42.439 --> 04:49.122
my soul A creeping loss of all control

04:54.562 --> 04:55.483
Oh, yeah.

